{"id":"n62808-1-10","stage":1,"title":"포도 · 葡萄","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62808-1-10-1","ko":"어떤 과일을 좋아하세요?","zh":"您喜欢哪种水果呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个。","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"과일을","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과일을","audio":"/audio/57f9e12ecc4539af2a99.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아하세요?","meaning":"爱吃，爱喝","explanation":"좋아하다：爱吃，爱喝；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"3","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아하세요","audio":"/audio/dff68e1bb91a7d3e7728.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"ed0e90733d1a21cf","term":"과일","zh":"水果","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3","entryId":"18264","definition":"苹果、梨、葡萄、栗子等主要长在树上的，人们可以食用的果子。","pronunciation":["과ː일"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"爱吃，爱喝","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"特别喜欢吃或喝特定的食物。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c5ec46f82c13dc641910.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62808-1-10-2","ko":"새콤하고 달콤한 포도를 좋아해요.","zh":"我喜欢又酸又甜的葡萄。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새콤하고","meaning":"酸溜溜","explanation":"새콤하다：酸溜溜；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"새콤하다","audio":"/audio/06e01e1b1617bed26039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62654","senseId":"1","lemma":"새콤하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새콤하고","audio":"/audio/03c7358261374665812b.mp3"}},{"text":"달콤한","meaning":"香甜","explanation":"달콤하다：香甜；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"달콤하다","audio":"/audio/a0b20d926a76285c586c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44157","senseId":"1","lemma":"달콤하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달콤한","audio":"/audio/d961887f82a656f3f3a4.mp3"}},{"text":"포도를","meaning":"葡萄","explanation":"포도：葡萄；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"포도","audio":"/audio/0f7706d92c4d69b9de0c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62808","senseId":"1","lemma":"포도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"포도를","audio":"/audio/3c00cdefb1819f98aee0.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아해요.","meaning":"爱吃，爱喝","explanation":"좋아하다：爱吃，爱喝；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"3","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아해요","audio":"/audio/5f9319d9c169323b3fe4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"06e01e1b1617bed2","term":"새콤하다","zh":"酸溜溜","audio":"/audio/06e01e1b1617bed26039.mp3","entryId":"62654","definition":"味道略酸而爽口。","pronunciation":["새콤하다"]},{"id":"a0b20d926a76285c","term":"달콤하다","zh":"香甜","audio":"/audio/a0b20d926a76285c586c.mp3","entryId":"44157","definition":"味道或气味甜得令人开心。","pronunciation":["달콤하다"]},{"id":"0f7706d92c4d69b9","term":"포도","zh":"葡萄","audio":"/audio/0f7706d92c4d69b9de0c.mp3","entryId":"62808","definition":"由甜美而微酸的小果实结成一串的紫色水果。","pronunciation":["포도"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"爱吃，爱喝","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"特别喜欢吃或喝特定的食物。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9bc1138ed34eaf940bd8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.59,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?